{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Note: <strong>Shellborne</strong> is currently in the <strong><u>beta</u></strong><u> <strong>phase</strong></u>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shellborne</strong> is a student\u2011made, completely <strong>free to play</strong>, co\u2011op adventure\u2014no paywalls, just pure turtle\u2011powered fun. <br><br>If you want to support us, join our community discord and give us feedback. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/6f62bb77233c682538259ae0840e4b59.avif?t=1754682325\" /></div>Collect Resources and Remove Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harvest wood, mine stone, and gather berries,  <br>then load them onto your trusty turtle to carry for you. <br>Smash through debris and rebuild bridges to carve out a safe route for your turtle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/6f62bb77233c682538259ae0840e4b59.avif?t=1754682325\" /></div>The evil fog hunts your turtle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A living wall of mist moves toward you, hungry for your magical turtle.  <br>It sends Spirits to slow you down - keep them away and keep running. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">   <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/6f62bb77233c682538259ae0840e4b59.avif?t=1754682325\" /></div><span class=\"bb_strike\">Buy upgrades.</span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_strike\">When you reach a safe camp, spend leftover resources to upgrade your turtle. </span><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_strike\">Make your turtle run faster, carry more, and stay stronger for the next stage.</span><br><br><br><br><strong><u>Coming Soon</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/extras/6f62bb77233c682538259ae0840e4b59.avif?t=1754682325\" /></div>Work together and communicate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordination is key as you can only carry one tool at a time.<br>Discuss roles and swap gear at the right moment to clear the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note: The Game is about playing with friends, use the Steam friend list for invites. <br>Use the Steam voice chat or an external tool for communication.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625950?t=1754682325","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/ff05dd37f6700597393d7e6091c92509f02c9919/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754682325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/77e893912095e06ac8b67b0588f3446807f106e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754682325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625950/77e893912095e06ac8b67b0588f3446807f106e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754682325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Note: <strong>Shellborne</strong> is currently in the <strong><u>beta</u></strong><u> <strong>phase</strong></u>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shellborne</strong> is a student\u2011made, completely <strong>free to play</strong>, co\u2011op adventure\u2014no paywalls, just pure turtle\u2011powered fun. <br><br>If you want to support us, 